      q: "Can I get the AI Receptionist with the other AI services?",
      a: "Yes. The AI Pack is C$399.99 per month for all three: AI Receptionist, Online Receptionist, and Smart Follow-up.",
    },
    {
      q: "Who is the AI Receptionist best for?",
      a: "Best in the industry for small businesses that miss calls while they work: trades, shops, clinics, garages, and other local service businesses across Canada.",
    },
    {
      q: "Does it work in French?",
      a: "Yes. WEBAO works in English and French, and the AI Receptionist answers callers in both languages.",
    },
    {
      q: "How do I start with the AI Receptionist?",
      a: "Add it on the pricing page or from the start form. Tell us your business name and how you want messages handed to you, and we set it up to answer as your business. Start on /start/ today, or email contact@webao.ca.",
    },
  ]}
